        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, at evaporation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, at evaporation plant
This dataset describes the process of evaporation of the liquified natural gas in Japan.;
Synonyms: LNG; 
UUID: 15fd3a88-88bc-3673-a7d1-882a1a2de88a
This dataset considers the needed input of natural gas, the energy consumption as well as the infrastructure.
Location: energy consumption is etrapolated from an Italian plant
Technology: average technology assumed
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Publication 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_15fd3a88-88bc-3673-a7d1-882a1a2de88a.xml</text>
